+
+The previously recovered **Appendix G runs the other direction: NIST reviewing WJE's report**. It cannot be silently used as the task 5 artifact. The actual WJE-on-NIST review was not acquired here. The notice does not prove the review was delivered, omitted, adverse, suppressed or performed under an unchanged scope; signed terms, amendments and task-level delivery/acceptance are still needed. A05.
+
+The photography and analysis tasks also sharpen the native-record targets: selected-piece/region manifests, full-resolution files, selection/analysis records and their delivery joins. The visual report's unaided method does not by itself prove nonperformance of a broader award announcement. The notice and report may describe different work products; that remains a question for the actual procurement and delivery record, not a finding of breach.
